ning Brume\"> <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Cloak of Cunning Brume</span> </a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloak\" title=\"Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/38px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/50px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloak\" title=\"Cloak\">Cloak</a>\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Brume\" title=\"Cunning Brume\">Cunning Brume</a></dt><dd>When the wearer <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/40px-Disengage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengages\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp/20px-Disengage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Disengage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\">Disengages</a>, they also create a foggy cloud with 2 m / 7 ft radius that lasts for 1 turn.</dd></dl>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inlin